# Fire Nation Palace: "{1}{R}, {T}: Target creature you control gains firebending 4 until end of turn." Bot1 pays {R} and {B}
# from two Moxen, targets its Ornithopter, and when it attacks the same turn Firebending 4 adds {R}{R}{R}{R} that lasts until
# end of combat (CR 702.189a, 611.2a). It was cast on turn 1 so it can attack on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Fire Nation Palace
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
